<title>UK: Two Brent dates kept, one in dispute - trade.</title>
<headline>Two Brent dates kept, one in dispute - trade.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Two Brent crude dates nominated from the paper chains on Monday were kept by BP and one was still in dispute between BP and Shell UK, traders said.</p>
<p>-- Tom Ashby, London Newsroom +44 171 542 8145</p>
</text>
